-- 2. The Material Stock machine "Default Material Stock" (memory/Stock Maching/Machine/machines_material_stock.csv; class stock_machining_material_stock,
--    wage grade 0 - Metal): the stock as supplied, no operator and no rate, standard stock length 6096 mm. USA, and India (the
--    14 exports of memory/Countries data all list it, at no rate).
-- 3. process_taxonomy: the machine classes of the two catalog rows (Band Saw -> band_saw, Material Stock -> stock_machining_material_stock), so a
--    process finds its machines; and the group's third process, User-Defined Process (no machine, no wage grade: a step the engineer adds).
--
-- Not changed: the band saws' rates (815 and the India twins hold the reference file's and the India export's; the 14 exports list the
-- same 13 saws with the reference file's own data: setup, feed rate, load and unload times, stock limits; checked when this file is
-- generated) and the stock prices by form (material_stock_prices holds all six forms of the file's 105 materials for the USA).
